cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Station-MAE: weather station modelling with transformers"
abstract: >-
  A masked-autoencoder Transformer for the MeteoSwiss station network
  (PeakWeather). From a 12-hour window of observations at 155 stations it
  forecasts temperature, pressure, humidity and wind at 13 lead times from 0
  to 6 hours; whole stations are hidden during training so that forecasting
  and the reconstruction of missing stations are learned in one objective.
  Includes the station-local ablations and the per-station LSTM baseline
  reported in the accompanying capstone report.
type: software
